        {
            "id": "https://xsc062.netlify.app/20250421/",
            "url": "https://xsc062.netlify.app/20250421/",
            "title": "杂题选谈",
            "date_published": "2025-04-21T06:42:31.000Z",
            "content_html": "<figure>\r\n<img src=\"/20250421/neko.png\" alt=\"猫\" style=\"width: 75px\">\r\n<figcaption>\r\n猫\r\n</figcaption>\r\n</figure>\r\n<span id=\"more\"></span>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2 id=\"a---t-shirt\">A - T-shirt</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://codeforces.com/problemset/problem/183/D\"\r\nclass=\"uri\">https://codeforces.com/problemset/problem/183/D</a></p>\r\n<p>如果知道一个衣服序列，怎么算出期望呢？</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2 id=\"b---two-melodies\">B - Two Melodies</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://codeforces.com/problemset/problem/813/D\"\r\nclass=\"uri\">https://codeforces.com/problemset/problem/813/D</a></p>\r\n<p>如果设 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(f_{i,j}\\)</span> 表示第一个以\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(i\\)</span> 结尾，第二个以 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(j\\)</span>\r\n结尾的方案数，就会有一个弊端——假设现在有 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(i&gt;j\\)</span>，又假设有 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(j&lt;j&#39;&lt;i\\)</span>，那么就不可以直接把\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(f_{i,j}\\)</span> 转移到 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(f_{i,j&#39;}\\)</span>，因为 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(j&#39;\\)</span> 可能已经被第一个选过了。但如果从\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(i\\)</span> 转移就没有这样的问题（不管 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(i&#39;\\)</span> 是比 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(j\\)</span> 大还是比 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(j\\)</span> 小）。</p>\r\n<p>那就可以固定从较大的一维转移，也可以枚举所有情况。但是这样就会有一个问题，这是一个\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(n^3\\)</span> 的过程，而且对于不单调的内层\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(j\\)</span>，维护它的数值只能用带 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(\\log\\)</span> 的数据结构优化，似乎不太过得了；但\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(i\\)</span> 却可以前缀优化。</p>\r\n<p>其实，两个组是无序的，这意味着可以强制 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(i&gt;j\\)</span> 再从 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(i\\)</span> 转移；这个时候转移就和 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(j\\)</span> 没有太大的关系了，可以把 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(j\\)</span> 放到外层，对 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(i\\)</span> 前缀优化。可能需要注意边界的处理。</p>\r\n<details>\r\n<div class=\"sourceCode\" id=\"cb1\"><pre\r\nclass=\"sourceCode cpp\"><code class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><span id=\"cb1-1\"><a href=\"#cb1-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#include </span><span class=\"im\">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-2\"><a href=\"#cb1-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"dt\">int</span> main<span class=\"op\">()</span> <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-3\"><a href=\"#cb1-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#ifdef ONLINE_JUDGE</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-4\"><a href=\"#cb1-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>ios::sync_with_stdio<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"kw\">false</span><span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-5\"><a href=\"#cb1-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>cin<span class=\"op\">.</span>tie<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"kw\">nullptr</span><span class=\"op\">),</span> <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>cout<span class=\"op\">.</span>tie<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"kw\">nullptr</span><span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-6\"><a href=\"#cb1-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#else</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-7\"><a href=\"#cb1-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>freopen<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"st\">&quot;.in&quot;</span><span class=\"op\">,</span> <span class=\"st\">&quot;r&quot;</span><span class=\"op\">,</span> stdin<span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-8\"><a href=\"#cb1-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>freopen<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"st\">&quot;.out&quot;</span><span class=\"op\">,</span> <span class=\"st\">&quot;w&quot;</span><span class=\"op\">,</span> stdout<span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-9\"><a href=\"#cb1-9\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#endif</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-10\"><a href=\"#cb1-10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"dt\">int</span> n<span class=\"op\">,</span> res <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">0</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-11\"><a href=\"#cb1-11\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>cin <span class=\"op\">&gt;&gt;</span> n<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-12\"><a href=\"#cb1-12\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>vector<span class=\"op\">&lt;</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span><span class=\"op\">&gt;</span> a<span class=\"op\">(</span>n <span class=\"op\">+</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-13\"><a href=\"#cb1-13\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">for</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> i <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span> i <span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span> n<span class=\"op\">;</span> <span class=\"op\">++</span>i<span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-14\"><a href=\"#cb1-14\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>cin <span class=\"op\">&gt;&gt;</span> a<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">];</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-15\"><a href=\"#cb1-15\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>vector<span class=\"op\">&lt;</span><span class=\"bu\">std::</span>vector<span class=\"op\">&lt;</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span><span class=\"op\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"op\">&gt;</span> f<span class=\"op\">(</span>n <span class=\"op\">+</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">,</span> <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>vector<span class=\"op\">&lt;</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span><span class=\"op\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span>n <span class=\"op\">+</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">));</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-16\"><a href=\"#cb1-16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">for</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> j <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">0</span><span class=\"op\">;</span> j <span class=\"op\">&lt;</span> n<span class=\"op\">;</span> <span class=\"op\">++</span>j<span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-17\"><a href=\"#cb1-17\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>vector<span class=\"op\">&lt;</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span><span class=\"op\">&gt;</span> mx<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dv\">100002</span><span class=\"op\">),</span> mmx<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dv\">7</span><span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-18\"><a href=\"#cb1-18\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"cf\">for</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> i <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span> i <span class=\"op\">&lt;</span> j<span class=\"op\">;</span> <span class=\"op\">++</span>i<span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-19\"><a href=\"#cb1-19\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            mx<span class=\"op\">[</span>a<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]]</span> <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>max<span class=\"op\">(</span>mx<span class=\"op\">[</span>a<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]],</span> f<span class=\"op\">[</span>j<span class=\"op\">][</span>i<span class=\"op\">]);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-20\"><a href=\"#cb1-20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            mmx<span class=\"op\">[</span>a<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">%</span> <span class=\"dv\">7</span><span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>max<span class=\"op\">(</span>mmx<span class=\"op\">[</span>a<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">%</span> <span class=\"dv\">7</span><span class=\"op\">],</span> f<span class=\"op\">[</span>j<span class=\"op\">][</span>i<span class=\"op\">]);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-21\"><a href=\"#cb1-21\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"op\">&#125;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-22\"><a href=\"#cb1-22\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"cf\">for</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> i <span class=\"op\">=</span> j <span class=\"op\">+</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span> i <span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span> n<span class=\"op\">;</span> <span class=\"op\">++</span>i<span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-23\"><a href=\"#cb1-23\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            f<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">][</span>j<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>max<span class=\"op\">(&#123;</span> <span class=\"op\">!!</span>i <span class=\"op\">+</span> <span class=\"op\">!!</span>j<span class=\"op\">,</span> mx<span class=\"op\">[</span>a<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">-</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">+</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">,</span> mx<span class=\"op\">[</span>a<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">+</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">+</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">,</span> mmx<span class=\"op\">[</span>a<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">%</span> <span class=\"dv\">7</span><span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">+</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">,</span> f<span class=\"op\">[</span>j<span class=\"op\">][</span><span class=\"dv\">0</span><span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">+</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span> <span class=\"op\">&#125;);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-24\"><a href=\"#cb1-24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            mx<span class=\"op\">[</span>a<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]]</span> <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>max<span class=\"op\">(</span>mx<span class=\"op\">[</span>a<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]],</span> f<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">][</span>j<span class=\"op\">]);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-25\"><a href=\"#cb1-25\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            mmx<span class=\"op\">[</span>a<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">%</span> <span class=\"dv\">7</span><span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>max<span class=\"op\">(</span>mmx<span class=\"op\">[</span>a<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">%</span> <span class=\"dv\">7</span><span class=\"op\">],</span> f<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">][</span>j<span class=\"op\">]);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-26\"><a href=\"#cb1-26\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            <span class=\"co\">// printf(&quot;f[%d][%d] = %d\\n&quot;, i, j, f[i][j]);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-27\"><a href=\"#cb1-27\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            res <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>max<span class=\"op\">(</span>res<span class=\"op\">,</span> f<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">][</span>j<span class=\"op\">]);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-28\"><a href=\"#cb1-28\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"op\">&#125;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-29\"><a href=\"#cb1-29\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"op\">&#125;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-30\"><a href=\"#cb1-30\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>cout <span class=\"op\">&lt;&lt;</span> res <span class=\"op\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"ch\">&#39;</span><span class=\"sc\">\\n</span><span class=\"ch\">&#39;</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-31\"><a href=\"#cb1-31\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">return</span> <span class=\"dv\">0</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-32\"><a href=\"#cb1-32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"op\">&#125;</span></span></code></pre></div>\r\n</details>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2 id=\"cf633f-the-chocolate-spree\">CF633F The Chocolate Spree</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://codeforces.com/problemset/problem/633/F\"\r\nclass=\"uri\">https://codeforces.com/problemset/problem/633/F</a></p>\r\n<p>树形 DP\r\n求直径的时候，有一种方法是找到每个点下面的最大两条不交链。</p>\r\n<p>这里也可以有类似的求法。假设答案出现在子树 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(u\\)</span> 中（下面的 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(v_i\\)</span> 都是 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(u\\)</span> 的直接儿子），可以讨论 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(u\\)</span> 参与构成两条路径的情况：</p>\r\n<ol type=\"1\">\r\n<li><p>不参与构成任何一条路径，答案是 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(v_1,v_2\\)</span> 子树中的最长路径之和。</p></li>\r\n<li><p>参与构成其中一条：</p>\r\n<ol type=\"1\">\r\n<li>这一条与子树 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(v\\)</span> 完全相离，答案是\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(v\\)</span> 中最长路径，和 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(u\\)</span> 下面不经过 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(v\\)</span> 的最大两条不交链。</li>\r\n<li>这一条有一支来自 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(v\\)</span> 子树，但和\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(v\\)</span> 中最长路径没有重合的点。答案是\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(u\\)</span> 的点权、<span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(u\\)</span> 下面不经过 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(v\\)</span> 的最大链、<span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(v\\)</span> 中一条路径（不经过 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(v\\)</span>）和 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(v\\)</span> 下面一条链之和的最大值；</li>\r\n<li>这一条两支都来自 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(v\\)</span>\r\n子树：有重合，不可能发生。</li>\r\n</ol></li>\r\n<li><p>参与构成其中两条，答案是 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(u\\)</span>\r\n下面最长的四条链：路径重复经过 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(u\\)</span>，不可能发生。</p></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><img src=\"2.png\" /></p>\r\n<p>可以记录 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(u\\)</span>\r\n下方最大的四条不交链、<span class=\"math inline\">\\(u\\)</span>\r\n中选取一条不经过 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(u\\)</span> 的路径和 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(u\\)</span> 下方一条链之和的最大值、<span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(u\\)</span> 中最长路径求解。</p>\r\n<details>\r\n<pre class=\"cpp language-cpp\" data-line=\"42-44\"><code class=\"cpp langauage-cpp\">#include &lt;bits/stdc++.h>\r\nint main() &#123;\r\n#ifdef ONLINE_JUDGE\r\n    std::ios::sync_with_stdio(false);\r\n    std::cin.tie(nullptr), std::cout.tie(nullptr);\r\n#else\r\n    std::freopen(\".in\", \"r\", stdin);\r\n    std::freopen(\".out\", \"w\", stdout);\r\n#endif\r\n    int n;\r\n    std::cin >> n;\r\n    std::vector&lt;int> a(n + 1);\r\n    std::vector&lt;std::vector&lt;int> > g(n + 1);\r\n    for (int i = 1; i <= n; ++i)\r\n        std::cin >> a[i];\r\n    for (int i = 1, x, y; i < n; ++i) &#123;\r\n        std::cin >> x >> y;\r\n        g[x].push_back(y), g[y].push_back(x);\r\n    &#125;\r\n    auto res(0ll);\r\n    std::vector&lt;long long> s(n + 1), w(n + 1);\r\n    std::vector&lt;std::vector&lt;std::pair&lt;long long, int> > > f(n + 1, std::vector&lt;std::pair&lt;long long, int> > (4));\r\n    std::function&lt;void(int, int)> DFS = [&](int x, int fa) &#123;\r\n        f[x][0] = &#123; 0, x &#125;;\r\n        w[x] = s[x] = a[x];\r\n        for (auto i : g[x])\r\n            if (i != fa) &#123;\r\n                DFS(i, x);\r\n                &#123;\r\n                    if (f[i][0].first + a[i] > f[x][3].first)\r\n                        f[x][3].first = f[i][0].first + a[i], f[x][3].second = i;\r\n                    std::sort(f[x].begin(), f[x].end(), std::greater&lt;std::pair&lt;long long, int> > ());\r\n                &#125;\r\n                w[x] = std::max(w[x], w[i] + a[x]);\r\n            &#125;\r\n        auto mx(0ll);\r\n        for (auto i : g[x])\r\n            if (i != fa) &#123;\r\n                s[x] = std::max(&#123; s[x], s[i], f[x][0].first + f[x][1].first + a[x] &#125;);\r\n                w[x] = std::max(w[x], (f[x][0].second != i ? f[x][0] : f[x][1]).first + s[i] + a[x]);\r\n                res = std::max(&#123; res,\r\n                    mx + s[i], // 情况 1\r\n                    (f[x][0].second == i ? f[x][1].first + f[x][2].first : (f[x][1].second == i ? f[x][0].first + f[x][2].first : f[x][0].first + f[x][1].first)) + s[i] + a[x], // 情况 2.1\r\n                    (f[x][0].second == i ? f[x][1].first : f[x][0].first) + w[i] + a[x], // 情况 2.2\r\n                &#125;);\r\n                mx = std::max(mx, s[i]);\r\n            &#125;\r\n    //     printf(\"%d: res = %lld\\n  f: \\n\", a[x], res);\r\n    //     for (int i = 0; i < 4; ++i)\r\n    //         printf(\"    [%d] %lld\\n\", f[x][i].second, f[x][i].first);\r\n    //     printf(\"  s: %lld\\n  w: %lld\\n\", s[x], w[x]);\r\n    &#125;;\r\n    DFS(1, -1);\r\n    std::cout << res << '\\n';\r\n    return 0;\r\n&#125;</code></pre>\r\n</details>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2 id=\"c---巡逻\">C - 巡逻</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P3629\"\r\nclass=\"uri\">https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P3629</a></p>\r\n<p>你可能需要注意：目的是遍历所有边而非所有点。</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(K=1\\)</span>\r\n的时候，环上除了关键边的所有边经过次数会减 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(1\\)</span>。所以选树的直径就可以最优。</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(K=2\\)</span> 的时候，答案是 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(2\\times (m + 2)\\)</span> 减去两个边构成的环的\r\n<em>并集减交集</em> 大小 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(L\\)</span>。环实际上是不存在的，<span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(L\\)</span> 其实是两条路径 <em>并集减交集</em>\r\n再加上两条新边的值。</p>\r\n<p>两条路径有交的时候，可以等效成无交的情况：</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"1.png\" /></p>\r\n<p>就化归成上一个问题了。注意此时情况 3 可能发生；同时情况 2.2\r\n可以选取经过 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(v\\)</span> 的路径。</p>\r\n<details>\r\n<pre class=\"cpp language-cpp\" data-line=\"55-56,64-67\"><code class=\"cpp langauage-cpp\">#include &lt;bits/stdc++.h>\r\nint main() &#123;\r\n#ifdef ONLINE_JUDGE\r\n    std::ios::sync_with_stdio(false);\r\n    std::cin.tie(nullptr), std::cout.tie(nullptr);\r\n#else\r\n    std::freopen(\".in\", \"r\", stdin);\r\n    std::freopen(\".out\", \"w\", stdout);\r\n#endif\r\n    int n, k;\r\n    std::cin >> n >> k;\r\n    std::vector&lt;std::vector&lt;int> > g(n + 1);\r\n    for (int i = 1, x, y; i < n; ++i) &#123;\r\n        std::cin >> x >> y;\r\n        g[x].push_back(y), g[y].push_back(x);\r\n    &#125;\r\n    int res = 0;\r\n    if (k == 1) &#123;\r\n        std::vector&lt;std::vector&lt;std::pair&lt;int, int> > > f(n + 1, std::vector&lt;std::pair&lt;int, int> > (2));\r\n        std::function&lt;void(int, int)> DFS = [&](int x, int fa) &#123;\r\n            f[x][0] = &#123; 0, x &#125;;\r\n            for (auto i : g[x])\r\n                if (i != fa) &#123;\r\n                    DFS(i, x);\r\n                    &#123;\r\n                        if (f[i][0].first + 1 > f[x][1].first)\r\n                            f[x][1].first = f[i][0].first + 1, f[x][1].second = i;\r\n                        std::sort(f[x].begin(), f[x].end(), std::greater&lt;std::pair&lt;int, int> > ());\r\n                    &#125;\r\n                &#125;\r\n            res = std::max(res, f[x][0].first + f[x][1].first);\r\n        &#125;;\r\n        DFS(1, -1);\r\n        std::cout << 2 * n - res - 1 << '\\n';\r\n    &#125;\r\n    else &#123;\r\n        std::vector&lt;int> s(n + 1), w(n + 1);\r\n        std::vector&lt;std::vector&lt;std::pair&lt;int, int> > > f(n + 1, std::vector&lt;std::pair&lt;int, int> > (4));\r\n        std::function&lt;void(int, int)> DFS = [&](int x, int fa) &#123;\r\n            f[x][0] = &#123; 0, x &#125;;\r\n            for (auto i : g[x])\r\n                if (i != fa) &#123;\r\n                    DFS(i, x);\r\n                    &#123;\r\n                        if (f[i][0].first + 1 > f[x][3].first)\r\n                            f[x][3].first = f[i][0].first + 1, f[x][3].second = i;\r\n                        std::sort(f[x].begin(), f[x].end(), std::greater&lt;std::pair&lt;int, int> > ());\r\n                    &#125;\r\n                    w[x] = std::max(w[x], w[i] + 1);\r\n                &#125;\r\n            &#123;\r\n                int t = 0;\r\n                for (auto [v, id] : f[x])\r\n                    t += v;\r\n                res = std::max(res, t); // 情况 3\r\n                w[x] = std::max(w[x], t - f[x][3].first); // 路径可经过 u\r\n            &#125;\r\n            int mx = 0;\r\n            for (auto i : g[x])\r\n                if (i != fa) &#123;\r\n                    s[x] = std::max(&#123; s[x], s[i], f[x][0].first + f[x][1].first &#125;);\r\n                    w[x] = std::max(w[x], (f[x][0].second != i ? f[x][0] : f[x][1]).first + std::max(s[i], f[i][0].first + 1));\r\n                    res = std::max(&#123; res,\r\n                        mx + s[i], // 情况 1\r\n                        (f[x][0].second == i ? f[x][1].first + f[x][2].first : (f[x][1].second == i ? f[x][0].first + f[x][2].first : f[x][0].first + f[x][1].first)) + s[i], // 情况 2.1\r\n                        (f[x][0].second == i ? f[x][1].first : f[x][0].first) + w[i] + 1, // 情况 2.2\r\n                    &#125;);\r\n                    mx = std::max(mx, s[i]);\r\n                &#125;\r\n        &#125;;\r\n        DFS(1, -1);\r\n        std::cout << 2 * (n + 1) - res - 2 << '\\n';\r\n    &#125;\r\n    return 0;\r\n&#125;</code></pre>\r\n</details>\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2 id=\"d---瞬间传送-teleport\">D - 瞬间传送 / Teleport</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P11915\"\r\nclass=\"uri\">https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P11915</a></p>\r\n<p>需要观察到一个很厉害的贪心策略：如果钦定所有点的距离不大于 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(r\\)</span>，且存在 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(d(i,j)&gt;r\\)</span>。<strong>假设</strong>\r\n一种满足条件的新边是 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\((u,v)\\)</span>（由于两者无序，不妨钦定 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(d(i,u)&lt;d(i,v)\\)</span>），可以进行讨论：</p>\r\n<ol type=\"1\">\r\n<li><p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(d(j,v)&lt;d(j,u)\\)</span>：</p>\r\n<p>此时最优路径为 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(i\\to u\\to v\\to\r\nj\\)</span>，判断一下这种方案是否不大于 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(r\\)</span> 就可以了。</p></li>\r\n<li><p><span class=\"math inline\">\\(d(j,v)\\ge d(j, u)\\)</span>：</p>\r\n<p>此时不管是走 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(i\\to u\\to v\\to j\\)</span>\r\n还是 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(i\\to v\\to u\\to j\\)</span>\r\n都不如走已经存在的 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(i\\to u\\to j\\)</span>\r\n这条路径，也就是说如果要走新边，代价是一定比原距离大，更是比 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(r\\)</span> 大的；也就是说，<span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\((u,v)\\)</span> 不能解决 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\((i,j)\\)</span>\r\n之间的问题，假设就不成立了。</p></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>综上，只需要判断 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(i\\to u\\to v\\to j\\le\r\nr\\)</span> 是否成立，就可以判断 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\((u,v)\\)</span> 是否合法。从大到小枚举 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(r\\)</span>，同时维护当前依然合法的 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\((u,v)\\)</span>（显然是有单调性的），对于不合法的\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\((i,j)\\)</span>，枚举每个 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(i\\)</span>，维护 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(\\max\\{d(v,j)\\}\\)</span>，精细实现（主要是利用各种均摊）一下就能\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(O(n^3)\\)</span>。</p>\r\n<p>这里具体提一下需要摊的几个点：</p>\r\n<ol type=\"1\">\r\n<li>枚举到 <span class=\"math inline\">\\(r\\)</span> 的时候用所有 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(d(i,j)=r+1\\)</span> 把 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(v\\)</span> 在 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(i\\)</span> 处的最大 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(d(v,j)\\)</span> 更新，方便后面 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(O(n)\\)</span> 地 check。摊出来是 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(O(n^3)\\)</span> 的。</li>\r\n<li>枚举仍然处在合法队列里的 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\((u,v)\\)</span>，如果 check 合法，就说明对于当前\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">\\(r\\)</span> 至少存在一个合法解，就可以\r\n<code>break</code> 了；否则，把 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\((u,v)\\)</span> 弹出，继续 check\r\n下一条边。这样每条边只会被弹出一次，而未弹出边的 check 次数最多是 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(O(n)\\)</span>；加上 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(O(n)\\)</span> 的 check，摊出来是 <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(O(n^3)\\)</span> 的。</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<details>\r\n<div class=\"sourceCode\" id=\"cb2\"><pre\r\nclass=\"sourceCode cpp\"><code class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><span id=\"cb2-1\"><a href=\"#cb2-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#include </span><span class=\"im\">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-2\"><a href=\"#cb2-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"at\">const</span> <span class=\"dt\">int</span> inf <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"bn\">0x3f3f3f3f</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-3\"><a href=\"#cb2-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"dt\">int</span> main<span class=\"op\">()</span> <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-4\"><a href=\"#cb2-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#ifdef ONLINE_JUDGE</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-5\"><a href=\"#cb2-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>ios::sync_with_stdio<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"kw\">false</span><span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-6\"><a href=\"#cb2-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>cin<span class=\"op\">.</span>tie<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"kw\">nullptr</span><span class=\"op\">),</span> <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>cout<span class=\"op\">.</span>tie<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"kw\">nullptr</span><span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-7\"><a href=\"#cb2-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#else</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-8\"><a href=\"#cb2-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>freopen<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"st\">&quot;.in&quot;</span><span class=\"op\">,</span> <span class=\"st\">&quot;r&quot;</span><span class=\"op\">,</span> stdin<span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-9\"><a href=\"#cb2-9\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>freopen<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"st\">&quot;.out&quot;</span><span class=\"op\">,</span> <span class=\"st\">&quot;w&quot;</span><span class=\"op\">,</span> stdout<span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-10\"><a href=\"#cb2-10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"pp\">#endif</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-11\"><a href=\"#cb2-11\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"dt\">int</span> T<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-12\"><a href=\"#cb2-12\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">for</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"bu\">std::</span>cin <span class=\"op\">&gt;&gt;</span> T<span class=\"op\">;</span> T<span class=\"op\">--;</span> <span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-13\"><a href=\"#cb2-13\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"dt\">int</span> n<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-14\"><a href=\"#cb2-14\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>cin <span class=\"op\">&gt;&gt;</span> n<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-15\"><a href=\"#cb2-15\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>vector<span class=\"op\">&lt;</span><span class=\"bu\">std::</span>vector<span class=\"op\">&lt;</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span><span class=\"op\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"op\">&gt;</span> g<span class=\"op\">(</span>n <span class=\"op\">+</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">,</span> <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>vector<span class=\"op\">&lt;</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span><span class=\"op\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span>n <span class=\"op\">+</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">,</span> inf<span class=\"op\">));</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-16\"><a href=\"#cb2-16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"cf\">for</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> i <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span> i <span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span> n<span class=\"op\">;</span> <span class=\"op\">++</span>i<span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-17\"><a href=\"#cb2-17\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            <span class=\"cf\">for</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> j <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span> j <span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span> n<span class=\"op\">;</span> <span class=\"op\">++</span>j<span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">&#123;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-18\"><a href=\"#cb2-18\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>                <span class=\"dt\">char</span> t<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-19\"><a href=\"#cb2-19\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>                <span class=\"bu\">std::</span>cin <span class=\"op\">&gt;&gt;</span> t<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-20\"><a href=\"#cb2-20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>                <span class=\"cf\">if</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span>t <span class=\"op\">==</span> <span class=\"ch\">&#39;1&#39;</span> <span class=\"op\">||</span> i <span class=\"op\">==</span> j<span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-21\"><a href=\"#cb2-21\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>                    g<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">][</span>j<span class=\"op\">]</span> <span class=\"op\">=</span> t <span class=\"op\">-</span> <span class=\"ch\">&#39;0&#39;</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-22\"><a href=\"#cb2-22\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            <span class=\"op\">&#125;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-23\"><a href=\"#cb2-23\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"cf\">for</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> k <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span> k <span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span> n<span class=\"op\">;</span> <span class=\"op\">++</span>k<span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-24\"><a href=\"#cb2-24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            <span class=\"cf\">for</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> i <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span> i <span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span> n<span class=\"op\">;</span> <span class=\"op\">++</span>i<span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-25\"><a href=\"#cb2-25\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>                <span class=\"cf\">if</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span>i <span class=\"op\">!=</span> k<span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-26\"><a href=\"#cb2-26\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>                    <span class=\"cf\">for</span> <span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> j <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span> j <span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span> n<span class=\"op\">;</span> <span class=\"op\">++</span>j<span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-27\"